  <!-- ============ SECTION 23 ============ -->
  <div class="section-header" id="s23"><span class="num">23</span><h2>Quick-Reference Glossary</h2><span class="line"></span></div>
  <div class="three-col">
    <div class="card cn">
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Handelsbrief</div><div class="glossary-def">A commercial letter relating specifically to the preparation, conclusion, or performance of a business transaction.</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Buchungsbeleg</div><div class="glossary-def">An accounting voucher — the source document supporting an individual booked entry.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card cn">
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">GoBD</div><div class="glossary-def">Tax authority administrative guidance elaborating the technical requirements for lawful electronic bookkeeping and record retention.</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Erbteilung</div><div class="glossary-def">Inheritance division dispute — one of the categories requiring full (not extract-only) book production under §260.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card cn">
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Gütergemeinschaft</div><div class="glossary-def">Community-of-property dispute — another §260 full-production category.</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Gesellschaftsteilung</div><div class="glossary-def">Partnership or company dissolution dispute — the third §260 full-production category.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="legend">
    <div class="ltitle">Key</div>
    <div class="lrow">
